{"unit_id":"yl216__dsh-approval-alert#card-zh","repo":"yl216/dsh-approval-alert","commit":"366e15f57a2255fcb3f388e6030310cc4b5603b9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-alert 是一款面向 DSH 网页及桌面界面的审批与提问提醒插件。它以浏览器端模块订阅 DSH 的会话状态，在审批、提问或计划评审等待处理时提供提示音和右下角浮层，并可在窗口后台时发送系统通知。用户可以按事件调整提醒开关、音效、音量和重复次数，也能导入本地音频；浮层或通知可跳转到对应会话。任务完成提醒可选开启。适合需要及时发现待处理请求的 DSH 用户；自定义音效保存在浏览器本地，系统通知需要环境支持并获授权。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:748","lib/client.js:623","lib/client.js:912","lib/client.js:1484"]}
{"unit_id":"yl216__dsh-approval-alert#card-en","repo":"yl216/dsh-approval-alert","commit":"366e15f57a2255fcb3f388e6030310cc4b5603b9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-approval-alert reminds DSH users about pending approvals and questions with sounds and a bottom-right toast. It can show a system notification in the background, repeat alerts, and open the related session. Users can configure event sounds and import audio stored in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:748","lib/client.js:623","lib/client.js:912","lib/client.js:1484"]}
